<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">1 Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc1">Pɔle Ná-Sɛʋɛ Mɔungi É Teʋeni Tesalonike Nuiti Ma</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Te</para>
  <para style="mt2">Pɔle Ná-Sɛʋɛ Mɔungi <optbreak/> É Teʋeni</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tesalonike Nuiti Ma</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔle ɠa é Tesalonike nuiti ta-zɛʋɛ mɔungi ɠɛai (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 1:1">1:1</ref></char>). Tanisu tɔ ɠa é ga Pɔle ná-sɛʋɛ mɔunpagi nii é kɛai, nii kɛai ga GALA daawooi ɠilazuʋɛ ta, ɠɛzɛɠɛzɛ. É zɛʋɛni kona ʋuulɔɔlugɔ maazu ɠila (51) kɛɠala leʋegai ma, Yesu zɔlɔɔga ʋoluma. Pɔle kɛɛni siɛgi zu é ɠɛni la Kolɛnte, é teʋe Tesalonike Egilisii ma, Egilisii nii é daaɠulani ná-keela ziɛi velesiɛi zu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 17:1-10">KKw 17:1-10</ref></char>). Bogɛ Keelaiti Kɛɛwotiiti ma zɛʋɛi zu ga Egilisii naa zu nuiti ti ɠɛni Zuifui tanigaani ta Gɛlɛkii ma mɔinmɔin.</para>
  <para style="ip">Egilisii laaɠulaai ma bɛ, Pɔle la ɠɛni zooni é ʋa lɛbi gola Tesalonike, naa ɠa é kɛa é sɛʋɛi nii ɠɛɛni la ná ʋoluma, nii a kɛ é kidaaleʋe nuiti iɲɔdɔ. Sɛʋɛi nii ɠa kala ungi ma mɔinmɔin su vaiti gaaɠulazu ba, é kalagi ve ɓalaa é lo faiti ba, ti ga kiti vaiti, naa ta ɠa ga ɠɛʋelei Keletiɛin maanɛai é eteai ziɛ la. Pɔle lago ɠiliʋɛ kpaan Kilista ʋaa laa velesiɛi ma. Kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ Tesalonike ɠidaaleʋe nuiti ti wola ɠilini naama vai ʋa ga zɛbɛ. Pɔle Kilista ʋaa laa velesiɛi ma vai zeɠeni, é ti zɛbɛlɔ la ga ti eteai ziɛ ga ʋelei nɛai la GALA bɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 5:6-8">5:6-8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Pɔle sɛʋɛi nii lɔɔzeiʋɛ ga é ná-tuʋɔ gooi laazeeli Egilisii ma, ta é GALA mama naa ná-faa zu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 1:1-10">1:1-10</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Naa ʋolu é ná-botiiti zɔɠɔzu lɛɛni, é zɛba fai niiti Timɔte ti woni ma, é naati suɠula (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 2:1-3:13">2:1—3:13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Pɔle zɛba, é kalagiti fe, é lo Keletiɛin ziɛ ʋelei ʋa, é zoloo Kilista ʋaa laa velesiɛi ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 4:1-5:25">4:1—5:25</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Pɔle sɛʋɛi ɠaaɓelagɛ ga é Egilisii luʋɔ ʋolu ga niinɛ, ta é ɠɛ ti ma ti fai pɛ kɛ, nii a kɛ ɛsɛ pɛ ge sɛʋɛi nii ɠala Egilisii zu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 5:26-28">5:26-28</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1"/>
  <para style="s">Tuʋɔ gooiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1"/>Nɛ̀i gè ga Pɔle, gá Silase, naa ʋɛɛ Timɔte ʋa, gá wo luʋɔsu, wɔi wo Egilisii zu Tesalonike taazuʋɛ, wo ga Ɠɛɛɠɛ GALA ta Maliɠii Yesu Kilista nɔnɔiti. Zaalai la wo ma, ta ziilɛigi ve wo ʋɛ!<verse eid="1TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ná-dituɠɔmai Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2"/>Gá GALA mamasu yeenɔpɛ wo pɛ wa-vaa zu, gi ɗa wa-vaa wo yeenɔpɛ gá-ƓALA faliiti su. <verse eid="1TH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3"/>Wa-ɠidaaleʋei ma luʋa ʋele ʋagɔi ta wa-nɛɛbɛi ma wotii, naa ʋɛɛ wa-ɠitogi wɔɔlɔ ʋelei ʋa de-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista letegi, gá ɠizɛsu naati su GALA gaazu nii é ga ade-Ɠɛɛ. <verse eid="1TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, gi suɠwɛɛ ga GALA ge wo nɛa ʋɛ, é yiimazeɠe ga woye, ga wo ɠɛ ga ná-nuiti. <verse eid="1TH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gi la Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeelini wo ma ga kpɔɛzuɠulai letelegi nɔ, kɛlɛ gi kɛɛni ɓalaa ga zɛbɛi, ta Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ná-kpɔbai. Naa ʋoluma, gi wola laani naa la, nii gi ɠɛni bosu. Wo suɠwɛɛ ʋelei gi ziɛni la wo zaama, é ɠɛ wo ʋɛ ga faa ʋagɔ. <verse eid="1TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6"/>Wo ʋilɛni gi-ɠɔɠɔ ʋogi ʋa, ta Maliɠii nɔnɔi. Wo kpɔlɔ mɔinmɔin sɔlɔɔni, kɛlɛ tama wo GALA daawooi zɔlɔɔni ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ná-koozunɛɛi. <verse eid="1TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7"/>Naa ma wo ɠɛa ga poogi kidaaleʋe nuiti pɛ bɛ Masedoane yooi zu ta Akayi yooi. <verse eid="1TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Maliɠii laawooi zeɠeni wo ʋɔ bɛ, daazeeli Masedoane ta Akayi yooi pɛ su, kɛlɛ é la ɠwɛni miná, wo ɠidaaleʋe vai GALA ma, naama wooi vazaga mini-o-mini, gi ɓɛdɛ la mɔ ba ga gi ʋa naa ta wo. <verse eid="1TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ti pɛ ta bosu, ʋelei wo yeezeini la gi wu, gi ʋaai ma wo ʋɔ bɛ, ta ʋelei wo ɠɛlɛni la kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti ba, wo lati GALA ma, ga wo ɗa botii ɠɛ zɛnvu su ƓALAGI ʋɛ, é ga GALA kitei, <verse eid="1TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10"/>wa ná-Doun Zunui Yesu maaɓɔunsu, é ʋa, é zeɠe geeɠɔlɔgi zu. Tɔ ɠa GALA ge buzeɠeni, é kula saai ya, tɔ ɠa é de ɠulazu GALA ná-ziiɠaawanai wu, nii é ʋaazu.<verse eid="1TH 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ná-botii é kɛɛni Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, wa ɓɔɠɔi wo suɠwɛɛ ga gi ʋaa vai wo ʋɔ bɛ, gi la ɠɛni ʋaani ná wafuun. <verse eid="1TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2"/>Gi kpɔlɔi zɔlɔɔga ʋoluma Filipe, ta ɓaaɠulama vaiti, eɠɛʋelei wo kwɛɛ da, GALA ge ziiɓaai veeni gi ʋɛ, gi GALA ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli wo ma, sakpegiti saama. <verse eid="1TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3"/>Tama toligi gi bosu ga nuiti, é la ɠulazu kaka faa zu, ɓaa kigaiziɛ ɲɔu zu, gi la ba ga gi nu nɔpɛ yaava. <verse eid="1TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4"/>Tama gá ɓɔɛzu yeenɔpɛ eɠɛʋelei GALA ge pɔ la, mazɔlɔɔ tɔ ɠa é vaani bu, é Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ɠaliva gi ma. Gi la ɠɛɛzu kɛni gi nɛɛ nuɓusɛa ʋɛ, kɛlɛ kɛni GALA nɔ, nii é nu yiimaʋɛ vaiti fɛɠɛlɛfɛɠɛlɛsu.<verse eid="1TH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5"/>Eɠɛʋelei wa ɓɔɠɔi wo kwɛɛ la, gi la nu lɛsu ɓɔɛ woni. Gi la woo nɛɛnɛgaa woni, wɔin ʋa ɠɛ gi ma ga gi nu ná-wali ɠula zea, GALA ka ga gá-zeelei. <verse eid="1TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6"/>Gi la lɛbiya nɔpɛ gaiziɛni nuiti zea, anɛɛ wo ʋɔ bɛ, ɓaa zɔiti pɔ bɛ, <verse eid="1TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7"/>tama ʋelei gi la ga Kilista ná-keelaiti, gá la zoo gi da wo ma ga maaɓaai. Kɛlɛ gi ɠɛni ga nu ʋagɔiti wo zaama, eɠɛ doun deei é ná-dointi sɛsɛbosu. <verse eid="1TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8"/>Wo nɛɛ ʋelei ma gi ʋɛ, gi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni, é la nɔ ga gi GALA ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ve wo ya, kɛlɛ gi ɓɔɠɔ yɛnvuiti ɓalaa, mazɔlɔɔ wo loni gi-yii ʋa gola. <verse eid="1TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, wo-ɠi ka su, ʋelei gi botii ɠɛɛni la, gi kpɔlɔi zuzo, gi botii ɠɛ folo ʋɛɛ kpidi ʋa, ga gi mina ɠɛ ga kasɔ wo tanɔpɛ unma, siɛgi zu gi ɠɛni GALA ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeelizu la.<verse eid="1TH 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10"/>Wa ga naa ma zeeleiti gi ʋɛ, ta GALA ɓalaa, gi ziɛ ʋelei wo zaama, wɔiti wo ɠidaaleʋeai, naa ɠɛɛni ɲadedai zu, ta telebodai, peelalazu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni gi ʋa wo letema. <verse eid="1TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11"/>Wo suɠwɛɛ ɓalaa ga gi naa ɠɛɛni wo ɠilagilagi ʋɛ, nii doun kɛɛɠɛ a kɛ ná-dointi bɛ, <verse eid="1TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12"/>gi wo lɛnɛ, gi wo iɲɔdɔ, gi ɠili wo ma, ga wo-ziɛ ʋelei zoloo GALA ziimai ma, tɛigi é wo loligai ga wo wɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ ná-masadai zu ta ná-lɛbiyai.<verse eid="1TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tesalonike nuiti <optbreak/> ta-ɠidaaleʋei ta ta-ɓɔlɔi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13"/>Gá mamagi veezu ɓalaa GALA bɛ yeenɔpɛ, tɔɔzei siɛgi zu gi GALA daawooi laazeelini la wo ma, wo yeezeini bu, wo la soni ga nuɓusɛ laawoo ʋe, kɛlɛ wo soni ga GALA daawooi. Tama toɠa ga naa ɠiteɠite. Tɔ ɠa é botii ɠɛɛzu wo-yiimaʋɛ, wɔiti wo ɠidaaleʋeai. <verse eid="1TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, wo ʋokɔɠɔgɛ Zudé Egilisiiti ma, ti ga GALA ná-nuiti, ti ɠidaaleʋeai Yesu Kilista ma. Wo kpɔlɔi zɔlɔɔni wa-you zu nuiti zea, ga naama wɔinzeɠemai ma ziiti nɔ, nii ti sɔlɔɔni, tiya ɓɔɠɔi, ta-nuiti zea, ti ga Zuifuiti. <verse eid="1TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15"/>Tiya ɠa ti Maliɠii Yesu ʋaani ta GALA goo wo nuiti. Ti gi wɔinzeɠeni. Ti la GALA ɛnɛkɛni, ta ga nuɓusɛiti pɛ sili nuiti. <verse eid="1TH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16"/>Ti ɠaaɓaani, ti pele leʋe gi luɠɔ, ga gi mina ɓɔɛ zii ɠiligiti pɔ, ti ʋa kizogi zɔlɔɔ. Ta ta-ɠotoi laazeelizu, nii ti kɛa yeeɠɛɠalai pɛ daawu. Kɛlɛ GALA ná-ziiɠaawanai ɓega ga zeeli ti ma.<verse eid="1TH 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle wɔin vai ga é Tesalonike nuiti ka mɔnɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, gɔun gi letemazu, ade balini ma kpusɛi zu yeeɠɛɠala go laawu. Kɛlɛ ada-ɠisiɛiti ti la balini ma. Wɔin wola ɠa gi ma, ga gi wo ʋɛtɛ ʋolu, gi ɠaaɓaani ga gi naa ɠɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18"/>Wɔin ɠɛni gi ma ga gi ɠale ma, gi ʋa wo ʋɔ bɛ. Nà Pɔle, gè ɠaaɓaani ná zeizu ɠɛ mɔinmɔin, kɛlɛ Setana pele leʋeni gi luɠɔ. <verse eid="1TH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19"/>Tama wa laade ɓaa, wo ʋa ɠɛ ga gá-ɠitogi, ta gá-ɠoozunɛɛi, ta gá-vɔnifaamai ma zalai, gá ɠɛ ɲaɠai ɠulazu la ade-Maliɠii Yesu ɠaazu, siɛgi zu é ʋaazu la? <verse eid="1TH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20"/>Ungo, wa ɠa wo ga gá-lɛbiyai ta gá-ɠoozunɛɛi!<verse eid="1TH 2:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1"/>Naa ɠa é kɛɛni, gi la mɔ ɠɛni zooga gi ʋa maaɓɔun kili bo, gi deveni ga giya ɠila, gi yɛ Atɛne. <verse eid="1TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2"/>Gi Timɔte leʋeni wo ma, ade-ɠɛɛloin, nii ti botii ɠɛɛzu ʋɔɔma ta GALA, é ɗa Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli é ʋilɛ Kilista ʋa. Gi teʋeni wo ma, ga é wo zɛbɛlɔ, é wo iɲɔdɔ wa-ɠidaaleʋei zu, <verse eid="1TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3"/>naa ɠa a kɛ, wo zaama, nu nɔpɛ ge mina ɲiikpi kpɔlɔiti maaʋele ma, nii ade sɔlɔɔsu. Mazɔlɔɔ wa ɓɔɠɔi wo suɠwɛɛ ga GALA ka é naa leveai ade ma. <verse eid="1TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4"/>Siɛgi zu gi ɠɛni la wo ʋɔ bɛ, gi boni wo ma ma yeeluɠɔ, ga kpɔlɔiti ta zeeli ade ma. Naa ma ka kɛai, wo naa zuɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5"/>Naa ɠa é ba, gè la mɔ ɠɛni zooga gè ʋa maaɓɔun kili bo, gè Timɔte leʋeni, é ʋa, é ɠi sɔlɔɔ wa-ɠidaaleʋe vai ma. Gè luani ga tɛga nui mina ɠɛ wo lɛɛni ga, gá-wotii kpein ge mina ɠɛ ga wafuun faa.<verse eid="1TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6"/>Kɛlɛ Timɔte ʋaai ma gi ʋɔ bɛ, é zeɠe wo ʋɔ bɛ, é wa-ɠidaaleʋei ta wa-nɛɛbɛi ma woo ʋagɔi woni gi ma. É boni gi ma ga wa ɠizɛsu gi zu ga pagɔ yeenɔpɛ, wɔin ɠa wo ma gola ga wo gi ʋɛtɛ, eɠɛʋelei wɔin gi ma la ga gi wo ʋɛtɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7"/>Naa maaʋele ma, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, gá-ɠidaaʋili faiti saama, ta gá-ɓɔlɔiti, gi iɲɔ ge lɔɔni wa-vaa zu. Wa-ɠidaaleʋei ɠa é gi iɲɔdɔɔni. <verse eid="1TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8"/>Niizu gá dɛ yɛnvuzu ʋolu, tɔɔzei wa loni kpaan wa-ɠilibalai zu wa Maliɠii. <verse eid="1TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9"/>Gá zoo GALA mamasu ɠale wa-vaa zu, é kula ɠɛ su, tɔɔzei koozunɛɛi liegɔi ʋa gi sɔlɔɔsu ada-ƓALAGI ɠaazu wa-vaa zu? <verse eid="1TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10"/>Kpidi ʋɛɛ folo ʋa, gá maanɛɛnɛzu gola ga é ɓɔ gi ʋa, gi wo ɠa, gi naa la wa-ɠidaaleʋei ma, nii a ɓɔ ba daazeeli.<verse eid="1TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11"/>GALA ɓɔɠɔgoi, é ga ade-Ɠɛɛ, ta de-Maliɠii Yesu, gá-ʋelei ɓɛtɛ, é lo wo ʋa! <verse eid="1TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12"/>Maliɠii yɛ wa-nɛɛbɛi zuwɔɔlɔzu yeenɔpɛ, nii é wo yɔɠɔzu wo ɠilagilagiti ta nuɓusɛi zɔiti pɛ tetema, é kɛ ga nɛɛbɛi naa ɠɛʋele, nii é gi-yiimaʋɛ wa-vaa zu. <verse eid="1TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13"/>É wo zɛbɛlɔ wo-yiimaʋɛti, wo ɠɛ ga nu ɲadegaiti, peelalazu nɔpɛ ge mina ɠɛ wo ʋa GALA gaazu, é ga ade-Ɠɛɛ, siɛgi zu ade-Maliɠii Yesu ʋaazu la, ta ná-nuiti.<verse eid="1TH 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Nu ziɛ ʋelei nii nɛai GALA bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, gaaɓelagi ɠa ga: Ʋelei wa ziɛ la wo GALA ɛnɛkɛ, wo naa ɠalani gi ya. Tama, ʋele ɠana wo ziɛzu la niina. Kɛlɛ niizu gá bosu wo ma, gi wo maanɛɛnɛ Maliɠii Yesu laaseigi zu: À kɛ ga pagɔ, wo ɗa li luɠɔma. <verse eid="1TH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2"/>Tama wo suɠwɛɛ ʋelei gi wo ɠalani da, é ɠula Maliɠii Yesu ya. <verse eid="1TH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3"/>Nii GALA ge pɔ wa-vaa zu, tɔ ɠa ga wa-ɲade fai: Wo mina ɓɔɠɔ lɔ koloɠologi zu, <verse eid="1TH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4"/>ɛsɛ ge zoo è-ɓusɛi zo ga pagɔ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ɛsɛ ge zoo è-ɓusɛi zo ga pagɔ</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ɛsɛ ge zoo anza zeɠezu kɛʋele ɲadegai zu ta unfemai zu</char></note> é eteai ziɛ ɲadedai zu, ta unfemai, <verse eid="1TH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5"/>wo mina ɓɔɠɔ lɔ gaazuɠulapɔ ɲɔi zu, eɠɛʋelei GALA kwɛɛtala nuiti ti kɛɛzu la zii ɠiligiti saama. <verse eid="1TH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6"/>Nu nɔpɛ ge mina kakama vaa ɠɛ ga kɛɛɠɛloin, ɓaa yaava vai. Maliɠii ɠa naama vaiti pɛ ma lukpɔi ɠaaleʋe. Gi naa woni wo ma, gi maaɓakpa. <verse eid="1TH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge la ade lolini kɔzɔba vaa ma, kɛlɛ kɛni ɲadedai. <verse eid="1TH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8"/>Naa ɠa é ba, zɔi nɔpɛ a ɠɛlɛ kalagi nii ʋa, nu laade é ʋa ɠɛ ɠɛlɛzu gooi ʋa, GALA ka é ɠɛlɛzu ba, nii é ná-Zɛnvu Ɲadegai veezu wo ya.<verse eid="1TH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9"/>Wo ɓɛdɛ la ba ga nu sɛʋɛ ɠɛ wo ma, é lo kidaaleʋe nuiti wo yɔɠɔzu nɛɛbɛi ʋa, mazɔlɔɔ wo naama ɠalagi zɔlɔɔgɛ GALA zea, ʋelei wa ɓɔɠɔ nɛɛ la ʋɛ wo ɠilagilagiti. <verse eid="1TH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10"/>Tama, ʋele ɠana wo ziɛzu la ɠɛɛɠɛlointi pɛ bɛ Masedoane yooi kpein su. Kɛlɛ kɛ̀ɛleaiti, gá wo lɛnɛsu, wo li luɠɔma mɔnɔ naazu. <verse eid="1TH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11"/>À ɠaaɓa, wo eteai ziɛ ziilɛigi zu, wo ɠaaɓa wo ɓɔɠɔ vaiti ma, wo boti ɠɛ ga wo-yeeiti, eɠɛʋelei gi wo ɠalani da, <verse eid="1TH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12"/>naa ɠa a kɛ wo ziɛ ga pagɔ ladalai zu kamaʋolu nuiti tetegi, wo mina ɠɛ nu nɔpɛ unma ga kasɔ.<verse eid="1TH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gɔvɛiti buzeɠe vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, gi la pɔ gi ʋa wo yɛ kpidii zu, naati ta-vaa zu niiti ti zaazu, naa ɠa a kɛ wo-yii mina ɓɔlɔ ga nui mɔtaiti kɛʋele, niiti kito ge la ti ʋɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14"/>Ade laaʋɛ da ga Yesu zaani, é wuzeɠe, é ɠula saai ya. Ade laaʋɛ da ɓalaa ga niiti ti ɠidaaleʋeai Yesu ma eyɛsu ti za, GALA ka naati buzeɠe, é ti ɠula saai ya, é ʋa ga tiye Yesu ʋɔ.<verse eid="1TH 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15"/>Wɛlɛ, nii ɠa gi dɛɛzu ga woye, eɠɛʋelei Maliɠii laawooi bosu la: Adɛiti da yɛ vulua Maliɠii ʋa voloi, de la lia naati tuɠɔ pɛ, zɔiti ti zaai. <verse eid="1TH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16"/>Mazɔlɔɔ deve wooi ɠa mɛni, geezuɠeela ɠundiɠii woo ɠa mɛni, ta GALA ná-puʋugi wooi, ta Maliɠii ɓɔɠɔi ɠa yei, é zeɠe geezuʋɛ. Niiti ti ɠiliai yɛgai Kilista ʋa eyɛsu ti za, naati ta wuzeɠe mɔunpa, ti ɠula saai ya. <verse eid="1TH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17"/>Naa ʋoluma, adɛiti da yɛ vulua naama voloi, da ɓɔ ti ʋa, ade lɛ tonaɓiingiti su, ga de Maliɠii laaɠomi fiilɛi zu, ta da yɛ niina Maliɠii ʋa ɠɔoɠɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18"/>À ɓɔɠɔ iɲɔdɔ ga niima wooiti, wo ɠilagilagiti pɛ.<verse eid="1TH 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Maliɠii ná-foloi ta kɛʋele ɓɛtɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, wo ɓɛdɛ la ba, ga gi sɛʋɛ leʋe wo ma, é lo naama voloiti ba ta ma yeeɠɛɠalaiti, yeei niima vaiti ti ɠɛɛzu la. <verse eid="1TH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2"/>Mazɔlɔɔ wo suɠwɛɛ ga pagɔ, ga Maliɠii ná-foloi ɠana ʋa eɠɛ unma nui é ɠulazu nu viliba kpidii. <verse eid="1TH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3"/>Siɛgi zu nuɓusɛiti ta ɠɛ ɠɛɛzu la ma: «Ziilɛigi ɠa gi ya niina, gi ɠulaa faa zu,» názu ɠa undaaʋiligi ɠulazu la ti viliba, eɠɛʋelei doun zɔlɔɔ koozuwanai a ɗa anzanui zo da, é la ʋoola ti ʋa pɛ.<verse eid="1TH 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4"/>Kɛlɛ kɛ̀ɛleaiti, wo la kpidi zu, ga naama voloi ʋa ɠula wo viliba, eɠɛ unma nu. <verse eid="1TH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5"/>Wo pɛ wo ɠɛa ga wozakalagi ná-nuiti, wo ɠɛa ga foloi nɔnɔiti. De la ga kpidii ta kuai nɔnɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6"/>Ade mina ɲi deɠɛmu, eɠɛʋelei zɔiti ti ɲiizu la, kɛlɛ maanɛɛʋɛ ga ade yɛ ɠaazu ɠa, de ɠɛ ga sɔɓelama nuiti. <verse eid="1TH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zɔiti ti ɲiizu, ta ɗa ɲi ga kpidii, zɔiti dɔɔi ti zosu, toɠa ɗa ti zo ga kpidii. <verse eid="1TH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8"/>Kɛlɛ dɛiti de ga foloi nɔnɔiti, ade ɠɛ ga sɔɓelama nuiti, ade kidaaleʋei ta nɛɛbɛi loo ɠɔba ga de-ɠaka makɛ ɠɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlai, ta da-ɠizogi ma ɠitogi ɠɛ de unba ga bɔɔlɔgi. <verse eid="1TH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge la ade lolini ga é yiiɠaawana ade ma, kɛlɛ kɛni kizogi zɔlɔɔ fai ade-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista zaalai zu, <verse eid="1TH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10"/>nii é zaani ade ʋɛ, nii a kɛ ade zɛnvui wo ʋɔɔma ada tɔun, siɛgi zu a ʋaa la, de ɠɛni vulua, ɓaa de zaani. <verse eid="1TH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11"/>Naa ɠa é ba, à ɓɔɠɔ iɲɔdɔ wo ɠilagilagiti pɛ, wo ɠilagilagi ɓɔ bɔɔlai ʋa wo li luɠɔma kidaaleʋei zu, eɠɛʋelei wo kɛɛzu la ɠiteɠite.<verse eid="1TH 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Falima ɠaaɓelagiti ta tuʋɔgiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, gá valizu wo ma, ga wo unfe naati ma, niiti ti botii ɠɛɛzu wo zaama, ti losu wo luɠɔ Maliɠii laaseigi zu, ti ɗa wo ɠala. <verse eid="1TH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13"/>À wa-nɛɛbɛi ɠula kɛlɛma ti ʋɛ, wo ti wɔɔlɔ gola ta-wotii maaʋele ma. À zei ziilɛigi zu ɓɔɠɔ ɠoba.<verse eid="1TH 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, gá wo maanɛɛnɛzu, à naati too ɠisu, niiti ti eteai ziɛzu gaaʋalaba vaiti su. Niiti ti iɲɔteʋeai, à naati iɲɔdɔ. À ɓɔ zobobɛlala nuiti ba. À yiilɔɔ ɛsɛ pɛ bu. <verse eid="1TH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15"/>À dama, nu mina faa ɲɔi ʋotokula ga faa ɲɔi, kɛlɛ à ʋilɛ faa ʋagɔi ɠɛɛ vai ʋolu yeenɔpɛ, wo naa ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ yɔɠɔzu, ta nuɓusɛi pɛ bɛ.<verse eid="1TH 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16"/>Wo ɠoozunɛai ɠɛ de yeenɔpɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17"/>À maanɛɛnɛi wo yeenɔpɛ, wo mina ɓɔlɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18"/>À GALA mama fai pɛ su, naa ɠa é ga GALA ziimai wa-vaa zu, wa-ɠilibalai zu wa Yesu Kilista.<verse eid="1TH 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19"/>À mina pele leʋe Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ná-botii luɠɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20"/>À mina bɛlɛɠula GALA goo wo nuiti daawooi ʋa. <verse eid="1TH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21"/>Kɛlɛ à faiti pɛ buuʋɛtɛ, zɔi pagai wo naa zo, <verse eid="1TH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22"/>wo ɓɔɠɔ zo, wo-yee mina ɠɛ faa ɲɔu ɠɛɛ vai ma zii tanɔpɛ su.<verse eid="1TH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23"/>Ziilɛi fee ƓALAGI ɓɔɠɔgoi wo ɲade mɛtu, é wo-yɛnvui, ta wo-ɠigi, ta wo-ɓusɛiti makɛ ga pagɔ, peelalazu nɔpɛ ge mina ɠɛ wo ʋa, ade-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ʋa voloi. <verse eid="1TH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24"/>Zɔi é wo loliga, toɠa ga wooɠɛɠila nui, toɠa a naa ɠɛ.<verse eid="1TH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, à GALA fali gi ʋɛ.<verse eid="1TH 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26"/>À ade-ɠɛɛleaiti pɛ tuʋɔ ga nɛɛnɛi.<verse eid="1TH 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27"/>Nà wo levezu, gè maaɓakpa Maliɠii laaseigi zu, ga wo niima zɛʋɛi ɠala ade-ɠɛɛleaiti pɛ bɛ.<verse eid="1TH 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28"/>Ade-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ná-zaalai yɛ wo ʋa!<verse eid="1TH 5:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5"/>
</usx>
